WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:05.330
New Ayakashi aiming to take
the Karasumori Site appeared.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:09.170
But that Ayakashi had
a spy with them.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.700
What is that man's purpose?

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.100
Metsu!

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.180
Is it time? Is it time yet?!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.280
Permission... granted!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.020
Let the battle begin.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.630
Wonderful! So this is
the power of Karasumori...

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.330
Junior high school student
Sumimura Yoshimori

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:44.500
and high school student
Yukimura Tokine

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.340
protect the Karasumori Site, where the school
now stands from the Ayakashi.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:53.080
It is their ancestral duty as Kekkaishi.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.790
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.660
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.860
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.760
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.200
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.600
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:19.140
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.480
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:28.140
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.650
Sha la la la la...

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:39.060
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.030
(Secret romance)

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:46.230
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.000
(A strange distance)

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:54.840
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:55.910
Yeah

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.380
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.980
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:08.320
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.080
They withstood the attack this time.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:35.750
But the next attack will
probably be the last.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.780
This land is splendid.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:42.780
My only goal was the experiment
but at this rate we can take over!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.130
I don't understand why
the superiors have been so cautious.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.920
This land is on our side isn't it?

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.460
Let's go, Tokine.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.490
Okay!

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.660
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:01.030
I can't move! How annoying!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:05.470
But it's not a problem
if I just segment myself.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.040
Hoi! Joso!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:09.640
Ketsu!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.280
Metsu!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:19.680
I see.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.350
The technically proficient girl
stops her opponent's movements

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.590
with her accurate techniques
while the boy

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.000
whose strength is power strikes it.
A coordinated team play.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.500
They're not bad as a team.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.770
However they just
wasted their energy.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.980
Shirahago will regenerate right away
with only that kind of damage.

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:41.970
What?

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.850
Yoshimori's Kekkai seems
to be getting stronger.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.850
He's using his head more too.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.920
Then can you help me a little?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.150
What are you going to do?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.300
When it regenerates itself

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:00.270
it gathers all its feathers
and then charges up.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.200
We should attack then.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.370
As you said
it'll start regenerating now.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.470
Let's go!

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:12.740
Hoi! Joso!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.570
Ketsu!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.950
What?! That kid still has
that much power left?!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.450
It's no good...

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.460
The Kekkai is too unstable
you can't destroy it.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.090
That's right...
Even if they are surrounded

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.570
it's not a problem as long as
they don't lose power.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:41.070
Tokine! Form another Kekkai
around mine!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.270
What?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.570
A multi-layered Kekkai!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.600
I have enough trouble
just maintaining this one!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:50.050
There's no way I can surround
a Kekkai that big!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.880
When it comes to this
the girl who lacks power is useless.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.710
Now it's just a contest of endurance
with the boy.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.350
But the land is on our side!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.760
What I should do now is to
create a multi-layered Kekkai

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.100
to stop its movements.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.100
That technique is
not suited for you.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.000
Grandma.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.940
The Kekkai technique requires more
than just brute force.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.940
That technique is
not suited for you.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.120
The technique
that's suited for me...

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.420
I can't hold it anymore!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.920
It's turning its feathers into
sharp arrows again...

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.760
Tokine! Isn't there some way?!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.520
Sharp arrows...

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.470
Tokine!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:50.040
Yoshimori! Don't miss
the chance to destroy it!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.270
You don't need to resort to
petty tricks.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.640
Just focus on your one Kekkai!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.820
I understand Grandma...

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.310
There is more to the Kekkai Technique
than brute force.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.390
What I must do now is...

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.710
Tokine...

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.790
...to sharpen it.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.700
I have to sharpen it...
and then sharpen it some more...

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.390
Ketsu!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.160
And pierce it!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:22.930
Metsu!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.140
Shirahago was powered up
to that degree and yet...

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.810
Tenketsu!

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:35.380
I underestimated the girl's power.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:40.690
Using long thin Kekkai to skewer...
I had no idea she would use it that way...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.620
And the boy with the
seemingly endless power.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.990
The Kekkaishi of Karasumori...

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.100
I suppose this is expected

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:52.900
seeing how they have protected
this land for the past 400 years.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.810
I'll acknowledge that.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.650
Looks like we'll need backup again.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.850
Yeah. we have no choice...

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:15.250
Hey, Tokine... What was that thing
earlier?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.230
That weird thin Kekkai.
What were those?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.160
Well...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:25.330
Were you secretly training to
come up with a new technique?!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.840
I just came up with that.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.940
Liar!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.080
Damn it! what's up with that?
Just you wait!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.450
I'll come up with an awesome move
of my own!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:39.480
Saying that you came up
with that on the spot

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.010
is so frustrating!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:42.910
You're so...

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.650
The power you have
is so much more...

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.660
What are you laughing at?!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.030
Nothing.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.520
There's no problem at all.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.370
I've learned enough from
watching them up close.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:03.430
Eventually this land will be ours.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:12.880
Impossible!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.010
There should still be time
before my limit is up.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.250
Is this also the power
of Karasumori?!

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.220
Darn it!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.230
What was that?!
I felt Negative Energy for an instant!

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.170
A Shikigami I set disappeared
at the same time.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.730
Shikigami?

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.900
When did she do that?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.280
Hakubi said that there were
other intruders.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.250
so I sent some out for recon.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:47.880
What?! Damn that Madarao
he never said anything about that.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.120
But he smelled like a human, right?

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.920
Yeah, but it's strange...

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.590
The scent is changing.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:08:59.620
Over there!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.000
Wait. Yoshimori!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:09.610
They still can't tell who I am
but they know that I'm here.

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.710
I better get out as soon as possible.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.970
Hey!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.820
What are you doing there?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.770
That fool! He's made a mess again!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.370
Oh, my...

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:45.110
Tokine's Shikigami...

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.520
You're with those Ayakashi, aren't you?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.980
Hey!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.450
Wait, you-!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:11.470
He's definitely not human!

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:12.870
Wait!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:14.140
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.110
Geez!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.540
I suck! What am I doing!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.670
Oh?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.740
The "ancillary" Sumimura
is going out to help too?

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.650
Or are you just out for
a late night walk?

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.330
What? I'm on active duty for life!

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.720
Unlike one senior citizen I know.

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.200
I don't wander around at night
without a purpose!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.830
I won't let that pass!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.060
Who is this senior citizen
you speak of?!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.770
You're two years older
than me. remember?!

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:52.340
This is no time for
things like this, I suppose.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.200
Right... We must hurry to Karasumori!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.040
I feel an ominous aura
coming from there.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.780
Yes, we must hurry.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:02.750
You're too slow.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.090
Oh no. I'm not!

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:07.450
He takes too long to charge up!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.130
How long does his arm stretch out?!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:22.640
I've gained distance from him.
I should be fine now.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.640
Now I just need to make my report
and my mission is complete.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:29.910
I won't let you get away.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.280
Ketsu!

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:33.850
What?!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:36.250
That kid...

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:40.050
He still has this much power left
after fighting Shirahago?!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:43.050
I'm pretty sure I caught him.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:48.000
Now what do I do.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:53.130
Fighting is not my forte
but I have no choice.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.030
This is?

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:01.380
It's a newly developed
Booster Serum.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:04.740
I doubt you'll need it
but take it just in case.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:09.050
Thank you very much, Byaku-sama.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:17.100
Now I can do it!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.120
According to the data

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.960
their Kekkai are weak
against slashing attacks.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.930
So if I sharpen the tips

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.000
add speed and power
to the strike

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.170
I can cut through this Kekkai!

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.780
That was close.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.100
What are you?

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.630
Here he comes!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.430
Ketsu!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:09.880
He tried to stop me
instead of defending himself.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.810
But my arm can bend many times

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.080
and stretch as far as I want!

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.020
I missed!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.350
The wider your swing

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.450
the more vulnerable
you are up close!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.060
This kid reacts fast.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.700
Does he grow stronger
in the heat of battle?

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:34.140
With opponents like him it's best
to just fight and find their weakness...

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.100
But I don't have time for that!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:40.040
I can't make an accurate Kekkai
unless I get closer!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:57.290
What power...
Definitely not human.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.390
Wait...

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.870
Where did he go?

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.440
I better fix this place up later,

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:11.340
or people will think
it's a crop circle or something.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.440
What was that noise?

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.660
Hey! That's... Sumimura-kun!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.490
What is he doing in the middle
of a crop circle?

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.930
Is this a dream?
No. it can't be!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.870
Sumimura-kun must've
come from space!

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.510
He's a prince from a star!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:44.900
Yeah right... not possible.
I'm going to sleep.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.620
I can't believe I let him get away.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.750
Yotheemori!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.220
You're still alive?

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.320
Y-Yoshimori! Oh no!

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.560
Madarao!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:11.570
I thought you got blown away
and your spirit passed on!

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.500
Whath a thing to thay!

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.940
I goth blown quite a wayth you know!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.410
What's that in your mouth?

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:22.510
It was flying above the school,
so I caught it.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.950
Can I eat it after you
finish checking it?

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:28.580
Yoshimori.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.050
Don't go crazy outside
of the school!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.450
Are you okay?

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:42.700
I used too much power...
I'm exhausted.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:48.570
I must report... to Byaku-sama
about Karasumori at all costs.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:54.040
The only clues
we have are his sunglasses,

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:57.180
an Ayakashi
that Madarao caught, and...

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.420
You know, that thing is really creepy.

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:03.660
But this is the best clue we have.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.660
I knew it. He's not human.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.130
But something's different.
He's not like previous Ayakashi.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.000
He looked like a human, right?

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:14.860
Yeah, for the most part...

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:18.700
But there was something
completely different inside.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.760
This thing looks like human skin.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.440
These are normal
store-bought sunglasses.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:26.700
I wonder if that Ayakashi was a scout?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.880
What do you think, Hakubi?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:34.440
He smelled like a human first.
but it changed later...

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:39.050
Or rather. it was more like
the scent of Ayakashi was leaking out.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.120
Just like Yoshi said.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.220
what's inside his skin
is completely different from the outside.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.690
The skin itself smells human.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:49.260
But he smelled disgusting for a human.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.770
If you noticed, why didn't you
tell me sooner?!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.940
There's no point.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.940
You only know how to deal
with enemies in front of you.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.370
Look who's talking!
You were blown away!

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:04.680
That's because you didn't
protect me with a Kekkai!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.350
- What?!
- What!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.750
What's bothering me is their method.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.310
What do you mean?

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:13.350
To look human.
Ayakashi disguise themselves

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:17.730
by using illusions or
transforming their bodies.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.390
They don't go through the trouble
of wearing human skin.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:24.460
They went pretty far to
cover up the scent of Ayakashi.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:28.530
Which means, they are conscious of us
and they are choosing their methods.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.980
They're doing a lot.
There has to be more than one.

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.200
Maybe an entire organization
is behind this.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.510
What?! There's going to be more
of them like that?!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:38.710
There's plenty more!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.340
All of them are coming after you!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.650
What we do know is...

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:46.990
Ayakashi can disguise themselves
as humans perfectly

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:50.000
and can make their way inside
the school at any time...

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.730
Speaking of which
Grandpa Shige said...

00:17:56.770 --> 00:17:57.860
Yoshimori...

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.860
I've said this before

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:03.780
but there's something strange
happening in Karasumori lately.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.630
Be careful.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:12.780
That's what he said...
Is this connected to that?

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:18.190
No he meant that Karasumori itself
is becoming strange... right?

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.590
But maybe that's why our enemies
are getting strange too.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:29.490
I don't get it!
Don't give me more problems!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.060
More? What other problems
do you have?

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:34.870
N-Nothing!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.100
You can talk to me about it
if it's work-related.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.740
It has nothing to do with work!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.340
Looks like there is...

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.880
You know, I've been wondering
about it for a while...

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.390
Are you hiding something from me?

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.180
N-No. I'm not!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.490
You're trying to do something dangerous,
aren't you?

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:55.290
Shut up! I'm not hiding anything
and it's not dangerous!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.350
Really?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.990
Can you say that while looking
me in the eye?

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.470
I don't sense the presence
of Ayakashi.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.030
That's...

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.520
Goodness!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:19.790
What a mess they've made.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.480
They used that much power
outside of Karasumori?

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.750
The flow of the air...

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:30.490
It seems this Ayakashi is different
from the usual ones.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:34.100
A new enemy after Karasumori...

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:36.700
We must continue to be on guard.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.260
We should start cleaning up.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.740
I'll leave that crop circle to you.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:43.830
What?!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:48.010
Only your grandchild is
stupid enough to do that.

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:51.250
What did you say?!
We are equally responsible!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.380
Says who?!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:55.850
You want to seal Karasumori forever?!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.890
You can't do something that impossible!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:03.420
I knew she'd get mad.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.960
It's your fault
you spilled the beans yourself.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:09.930
Seriously, what are you thinking?!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:16.840
But if I could do that...
nobody would get hurt again.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:24.050
That's what's been on his mind
this whole time?

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:29.120
In contrast I was only
thinking of myself recently.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.920
You're such a dummy...

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:38.820
I doubt that you can actually
seal it.

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:43.130
but endangering yourself
defeats the purpose.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.570
You have to stop putting yourself
in harm's way.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.900
I can help a little too.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.470
You got that?

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.100
Y-Yeah...

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.780
Now then. We have to start
cleaning up.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:04.120
But endangering you defeats
the purpose even more.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:16.830
You won't make it
to the castle in this state.

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:18.060
Byaku-sama!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.030
I'm terribly sorry!

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.970
They were much stronger
than expected...

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:25.240
I was able to obtain some
very interesting data.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:27.840
I wanted to report to you
as soon as possible.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.610
That won't be necessary.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:31.740
I will ask the worm directly.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:40.520
Byaku inserts worms inside
the Ayakashi to control them.

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:45.690
This is also how he obtains
data from them.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:52.130
Now I know what steps are required
to take over Karasumori.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:54.360
I'm taking back the human skin.

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:00.840
It seems it needs to be more durable.

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:06.950
Oh, that Booster Serum you drank...

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:09.510
It's still under development.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:12.090
If you use all your strength,

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:15.560
it will cause fatal damage.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.170
Your sacrifice for the sake of
research is appreciated.

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.560
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.970
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:01.270
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.700
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:18.190
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:26.930
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:40.370
Don't cry

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:49.120
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:53.950
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:02.370
Don't cry
